  "thag1.3:1.1": "3 paññaṃ imaṃ passa tathāgatānaṃ ",
  "thag1.3:1.2": "aggi yathā pajjalito nisīve ",
  "thag1.3:1.3": "ālokadā cakkhudadā bhavanti ",
  "thag1.3:1.4": "ye āgatānaṃ vinayanti kaṅkhanti. ",
  "thag1.3:1.5": "itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kaṅkhārevato thero gāthaṃ abhāsittha. "
}
